        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86161, Trail Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trail Cabinet Pull has a modern look. This Trail Cabinet Handle is available in a huge selection of sizes including 3 inches, 8 inches, and 16 inches. Choose from a wide array of finish colors for the Emtek Trail Pull.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/trail-refrigerator-handle-emtek-ap-86440\"><b>Trail Appliance Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/trail-cabinet-knob-emtek-86271\"><b>Trail Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Trail Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86161-specifications.pdf?v=1704262412\"><b>Emtek Trail Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 9 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86161:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86162:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86163:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86272:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86164:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86165:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86273:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86166:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86274:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
